BaikalOS Android (based on [crDroid Project](https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android/blob/16.0/README.mkdn))
===========

Getting started
---------------

Please see the [BaikalOS Project](https://github.com/baikalos/android/blob/16.0/README.mkdn) for building instructions, by device.


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via pull request.
